% S6: a passenger changing wings only boards the second elevator at I
% after the first elevator has dropped them off there.
%
% Not model-checked: it holds by construction. A cross-wing request is
% rewritten into its second leg only when the first elevator drops the
% passengers at I, so the second leg cannot exist before that.
% It cannot be written as a formula over our actions, since boarding is
% not an action and the model does not track individual passengers.
